{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Need An Army is a fantasy roguelike grid based deck builder about recruiting a powerful army! Recruit units, match patterns, and upgrade your grid in this tactical roguelike slots-based deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/19c7c62c79a4227499ff3b90b7be5ac4.poster.avif?t=1756749374\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/19c7c62c79a4227499ff3b90b7be5ac4.webm?t=1756749374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/19c7c62c79a4227499ff3b90b7be5ac4.mp4?t=1756749374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit Units from different races and classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got choices! Choose your next location wisely to reach the enemies commander!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align your units with the 5x5 grid to score bonuses and combos on your next attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade units, manage resources, play mini-games and build the best army!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/25c22effb64597869288e41a73e651eb.avif?t=1756749374\" width=460 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671320?t=1756749374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a